  "description": "'Who says the dead don't tell?'\nIt was the Japanese colonial era, and the black tiger lost the human couple who took him in and raised him without knowing why. A suspicious woman appeared at that time, Cho-hee. She dissects the body to determine the cause of death and the culprit...\nThe black tiger joins hands with Cho-hee, who does not know whose side she is on, to seek revenge. \n\n(Source: Naver; translated)",
